cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Alpha: An Open-Source Autonomous Multi-Agent AI Operating System"
message: "If you use Alpha in research or write about it, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
abstract: >-
  Alpha is a self-hosted, local-first platform where LLM agents plan, execute, and
  verify long-horizon tasks against real tools, files, and the web. It combines an
  asynchronous LangGraph agent runtime behind a FastAPI Gateway, a Next.js 15 web
  workspace, and an Electron Windows desktop application, with 130 native tools, 42
  middleware layers, 8 background supervisor loops, 24 public skills, Model Context
  Protocol support, sandboxed code execution across three tiers, a layered memory
  plane, and nine messaging channels behind a single Nginx entry point.
